  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「ペポカボチャ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9A%E3%83%9D%E3%82%AB%E3%83%9C%E3%83%81%E3%83%A3",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 111048836,
      "text": "ペポカボチャ は、カボチャ属の園芸作物である。かぼちゃの多くの園芸用品種を含む。\n我が国で「おもちゃカボチャ」や英語圏で「Ornamental gourd」と呼ばれる小型の果実をつける観賞用の品種ももここに属する。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Cucurbita pepo」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cucurbita_pepo",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1378575313,
      "text": "Cucurbita pepo is a cultivated plant of the genus Cucurbita. It yields varieties of winter squash and pumpkin, but the most widespread varieties belong to the subspecies Cucurbita pepo subsp. pepo, called summer squash."
    }
  },
